WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.200 --> 01:37.286
=Episode 12=

01:38.540 --> 01:39.499
Could it be

01:39.980 --> 01:42.299
that Madam intends to make me
a bedchamber maid?

01:48.540 --> 01:49.139
Mozhan,

01:50.139 --> 01:51.139
what are you doing here?

01:51.699 --> 01:52.460
Young Madam.

01:52.980 --> 01:53.620
Oh, right.

01:53.859 --> 01:55.579
Just keep doing what you did before.

01:55.579 --> 01:57.419
Make two orchid-pattern pouches for me.

01:57.540 --> 01:59.020
I'll give them
to the Young Master later.

01:59.059 --> 01:59.740
Understood.

02:02.020 --> 02:04.139
These handkerchiefs
were bought at the market.

02:04.540 --> 02:05.779
Do you recognize the stitching?

02:06.540 --> 02:08.739
These are indeed the handkerchiefs
we embroidered at the academy.

02:08.940 --> 02:09.980
Good gracious,

02:10.380 --> 02:11.940
that wretched instructor Zuo

02:12.299 --> 02:13.660
used teaching as an excuse

02:13.899 --> 02:15.859
to make my sister
work like a seamstress.

02:16.260 --> 02:18.500
Then she sold the finished handkerchiefs
at the market.

02:18.739 --> 02:19.459
Sister,

02:19.820 --> 02:21.459
we made these handkerchiefs.

02:22.220 --> 02:23.820
But the instructor treats us very well.

02:24.220 --> 02:25.660
She would never do such a thing.

02:26.859 --> 02:28.060
Morning lessons are about to start.

02:28.220 --> 02:29.619
If I wait any longer, I'll be late.

02:30.100 --> 02:31.220
What are morning lessons?

02:31.299 --> 02:32.859
Every day, we must stand
in the courtyard

02:32.980 --> 02:34.380
and embroider half a passage
of the Admonitions for Women.

02:34.780 --> 02:36.540
Only then are we allowed inside
to listen to the lecture.

02:45.540 --> 02:47.179
My poor sister is too simple.

02:47.260 --> 02:48.739
She won't listen to anyone.

02:49.699 --> 02:50.419
Don't worry.

02:50.699 --> 02:52.660
I will make sure what Zuo has done

02:52.940 --> 02:53.940
spreads to every household.

02:54.139 --> 02:55.859
She will never dare do this again.

03:01.340 --> 03:03.739
The Fu family's embroidery
is truly exquisite.

03:03.739 --> 03:05.299
Why do these girls

03:05.780 --> 03:08.619
seem to have been bewitched?

03:13.260 --> 03:15.459
Zuo lost the Fu family's support,

03:15.739 --> 03:18.220
yet she still rules unchallenged
in Ganlin Town.

03:19.060 --> 03:20.220
I bet she's got

03:20.699 --> 03:21.980
someone backing her up.

03:22.430 --> 03:24.950
(Admonitions for Women Hall)

03:40.940 --> 03:41.500
Sister?

03:41.899 --> 03:42.579
Get out here.

03:44.220 --> 03:45.299
What is it?

03:47.419 --> 03:48.859
Why are you hitting me again?

03:48.859 --> 03:50.500
Did you sell those handkerchiefs?

03:52.780 --> 03:53.500
No.

03:54.060 --> 03:54.859
I just thought

03:55.019 --> 03:56.220
I'd sell a few of them

03:56.459 --> 03:57.579
to buy myself some wine.

03:57.660 --> 03:59.579
You worthless fool.

04:00.380 --> 04:01.820
You call yourself a scholar?

04:02.019 --> 04:02.980
Don't you know

04:02.980 --> 04:05.299
these are all unmarried young ladies?

04:05.380 --> 04:06.299
If this gets out,

04:06.340 --> 04:08.060
- what happens to them?
- I...

04:08.060 --> 04:10.419
I risked my life
to get you out of prison

04:10.419 --> 04:11.579
and hide you here.

04:11.780 --> 04:13.459
If you still can't get it together,

04:13.459 --> 04:14.419
you'll spend your whole life

04:15.380 --> 04:17.660
as nothing but vermin!

04:23.660 --> 04:25.020
A vermin. That's what I am.

04:27.700 --> 04:28.179
Yes.

04:28.780 --> 04:30.780
A vermin hiding in dark corners,

04:31.340 --> 04:32.859
hiding
in the Admonitions for Women Hall,

04:33.340 --> 04:35.419
under this table.

04:37.020 --> 04:38.220
I can't see the light.

04:38.619 --> 04:39.819
I can't see anyone.

04:40.619 --> 04:42.259
Same people, different fates.

04:43.540 --> 04:44.900
Our fates today

04:46.259 --> 04:47.900
are all because of Fu Tingyun.

04:48.220 --> 04:48.739
If you've got the spine,

04:48.780 --> 04:50.340
go after Fu Tingyun!

04:50.340 --> 04:51.179
If not for her,

04:51.259 --> 04:52.499
would you and I

04:52.499 --> 04:53.939
have ended up like this?

04:58.700 --> 05:00.020
I've made peace with it.

05:06.220 --> 05:07.220
So should you.

05:13.619 --> 05:14.220
Get out.

05:15.859 --> 05:16.460
Get out!

05:33.379 --> 05:34.739
The mountain pass is hard to cross.

05:36.179 --> 05:38.220
Who will pity the one
who has lost his way?

05:59.379 --> 06:00.100
Go.

06:01.780 --> 06:04.100
Bring Concubine Lu to me.

06:06.299 --> 06:08.020
I have my ways

06:09.540 --> 06:11.499
to make Fu Tingyun suffer
the same fate as me

06:12.700 --> 06:14.540
and spend her life
mourning a dead fiance.

06:38.540 --> 06:39.419
Lin.

06:39.660 --> 06:40.619
What does

06:40.619 --> 06:41.700
this bugle call mean?

06:43.619 --> 06:45.059
The enemy is raiding the border again.

06:45.739 --> 06:47.419
Our troops will go out
to drive them off.

06:48.059 --> 06:49.379
That's when the bugle sounds.

06:50.220 --> 06:51.540
Will there be any danger?

06:51.819 --> 06:52.900
Don't worry.

06:52.900 --> 06:54.340
General Mo
is leading the troops himself.

06:54.340 --> 06:55.220
Those barbarians

06:55.220 --> 06:56.819
always make a lot of noise
but do little.

06:56.900 --> 06:58.580
They run at the sight of our banners.

06:59.780 --> 07:00.340
Then

07:01.739 --> 07:03.140
will Mr. Zhao be going too?

07:03.179 --> 07:05.020
All banner commanders and below will go.

07:07.739 --> 07:08.739
But

07:09.259 --> 07:11.299
Banner Commander Zhao,
due to his last absence without leave,

07:11.299 --> 07:12.340
can't go out this time.

07:13.220 --> 07:14.020
It's alright.

07:14.540 --> 07:16.340
There'll be plenty of chances
to earn merit later.

07:19.379 --> 07:21.179
Take less salt if you take more grain.

07:21.460 --> 07:23.419
- Take less grain if you take more salt.
- Mr. Zhao.

07:23.419 --> 07:24.660
Lu Dahu used his position

07:24.980 --> 07:26.020
to withhold grain from us.

07:26.020 --> 07:26.419
Next.

07:27.299 --> 07:29.179
Especially those without battle merits.

07:29.540 --> 07:30.540
Do you deserve salt?

07:31.259 --> 07:32.619
If you have any shame,

07:32.619 --> 07:33.660
take fewer supplies

07:34.179 --> 07:35.819
for the heroes on the battlefield.

07:37.100 --> 07:37.619
Next.

07:39.859 --> 07:40.299
Mr. Zhao.

07:40.499 --> 07:41.220
Mr. Zhao.

07:42.700 --> 07:43.900
We can go without salt

07:44.140 --> 07:45.179
and take more grain

07:45.379 --> 07:46.340
to fill our bellies.

07:46.780 --> 07:47.340
Next.

07:52.379 --> 07:53.140
Commander Lu.

07:53.700 --> 07:54.819
Grain is negotiable.

07:55.499 --> 07:56.939
But at least give us some salt.

07:57.980 --> 07:58.859
We

07:59.499 --> 08:00.619
can go hungry for a few meals.

08:00.980 --> 08:01.939
But with no salt, we have no strength.

08:01.939 --> 08:02.900
How can we train?

08:06.739 --> 08:07.580
- Yucheng.
- Hey.

08:08.100 --> 08:09.980
Buddy, don't fall!

08:09.980 --> 08:10.580
- Biao.
- Buddy!

08:10.580 --> 08:11.419
- You alright?
- What happened?

08:11.419 --> 08:11.780
You okay?

08:11.780 --> 08:12.540
Bear with it.

08:12.900 --> 08:13.819
I'll scrape some soot

08:13.980 --> 08:15.100
from the bottom of a pot

08:15.140 --> 08:16.140
to mix with your rice

08:16.379 --> 08:17.939
so you get some salt.

08:18.259 --> 08:19.179
No matter what,

08:19.220 --> 08:20.980
the training can't be delayed, right?

08:21.859 --> 08:23.059
What do you say, Commander Lu?

08:24.340 --> 08:24.780
Come on.

08:25.460 --> 08:26.299
Commander Lu,

08:27.819 --> 08:28.859
tell me the truth.

08:29.859 --> 08:30.739
Are we

08:31.259 --> 08:32.259
short on salt?

08:36.379 --> 08:36.859
Here.

08:37.859 --> 08:38.820
We have grain.

08:39.619 --> 08:40.580
But salt...

08:42.100 --> 08:43.460
we truly have none.

08:44.300 --> 08:45.539
Unless...

08:50.060 --> 08:50.940
Unless what?

08:51.899 --> 08:52.940
Give me three-tenths

08:53.139 --> 08:53.980
of your pay.

08:54.580 --> 08:55.499
Then I'll give you salt.

08:56.100 --> 08:56.940
Sorry,

08:58.019 --> 08:59.259
but I have a family too.

09:00.659 --> 09:01.700
Three-tenths is too much.

09:01.899 --> 09:03.539
I have so many brothers here today.

09:04.300 --> 09:05.940
I only ask for a handful of salt.

09:14.340 --> 09:15.739
No money? Then get out.

09:16.100 --> 09:17.539
Cut out the nonsense.

09:29.139 --> 09:30.420
How can I eat this?

09:30.659 --> 09:32.060
No taste at all.

09:33.460 --> 09:34.940
What are you mixing in there?

09:35.259 --> 09:36.460
Soot from the pot, Commander Wang.

09:38.460 --> 09:39.460
Salt is scarce.

09:39.659 --> 09:41.539
The men came up with mixing soot
into the rice.

09:41.619 --> 09:42.379
This idea...

09:43.139 --> 09:44.259
It's really hard to swallow.

09:45.899 --> 09:46.940
How can I eat this?

09:46.940 --> 09:48.220
Today's tofu

09:48.220 --> 09:49.139
is really fresh.

09:49.340 --> 09:49.820
Yeah.

09:58.259 --> 09:58.899
I can't eat this.

10:02.859 --> 10:03.460
Add some more soot.

10:04.779 --> 10:05.619
What's going on?

10:06.100 --> 10:07.820
Didn't they say we're short on salt?

10:17.539 --> 10:18.859
Is salt free for you or what?

10:20.820 --> 10:21.379
Commander Wang.

10:22.100 --> 10:23.019
A few of the brothers

10:23.100 --> 10:24.180
came from salt-making families.

10:24.499 --> 10:26.420
They can refine cliff salt
for their own use.

10:26.940 --> 10:27.820
Cliff salt?

10:29.499 --> 10:30.379
For their own use?

10:36.420 --> 10:37.539
If we have enough hands

10:37.539 --> 10:38.499
and enough time,

10:39.820 --> 10:41.460
we can produce enough salt

10:43.220 --> 10:44.340
for around a hundred men.

10:46.379 --> 10:47.539
Then we won't worry about salt.

10:48.019 --> 10:48.700
Really?

10:51.340 --> 10:52.100
Alright.

10:53.980 --> 10:55.779
If you can really deliver on that,

10:56.420 --> 10:58.060
I'll promote you to company commander.

11:05.499 --> 11:06.180
Mr. Zhao.

11:06.180 --> 11:07.499
If you really make it
to company commander,

11:07.940 --> 11:09.739
then we're one step closer
to returning to the capital.

11:10.340 --> 11:10.980
Yeah.

11:11.659 --> 11:13.859
Always with these clever tricks.

11:14.259 --> 11:15.700
I'll be watching

11:16.420 --> 11:18.539
to see if you even live
to take that post.

11:41.739 --> 11:42.739
Chuan, here.

11:43.539 --> 11:44.019
I'm coming.

11:59.779 --> 12:00.379
Mr. Tuo.

12:00.980 --> 12:02.739
That new Banner Commander Zhao

12:02.859 --> 12:04.019
can refine cliff salt.

12:04.019 --> 12:04.980
He'll steal our business
sooner or later.

12:05.859 --> 12:07.619
You've got that skill, huh?

12:08.019 --> 12:09.340
Then we'll take you alive.

12:09.779 --> 12:10.420
Guys,

12:11.060 --> 12:11.980
- get him!
- (Yes!)

12:11.980 --> 12:13.379
Chuan, go warn the folks down the hill.

12:13.379 --> 12:13.899
Got it.

12:14.139 --> 12:14.580
Let's go!

12:14.580 --> 12:15.220
Stop running!

12:15.220 --> 12:16.019
Catch them!

12:22.859 --> 12:23.859
Stop!

12:24.259 --> 12:24.820
Hold it!

12:24.820 --> 12:25.539
Get them!

12:35.259 --> 12:36.060
Help!

12:37.980 --> 12:38.859
Quick, save him!

12:39.940 --> 12:40.779
Commander Lu,

12:40.820 --> 12:41.659
please save him.

12:41.859 --> 12:42.779
A group of bandits

12:42.940 --> 12:44.100
took Mr. Zhao up the mountain.

12:44.859 --> 12:46.340
The bandits came so suddenly.

12:46.940 --> 12:48.859
Who knows how many more are up there?

12:49.379 --> 12:51.580
Rushing in blind is not wise.

12:52.899 --> 12:54.700
Let's wait for Commander Wang
to return to camp.

13:06.019 --> 13:07.859
Does he really think
he'll make it back alive?

13:09.220 --> 13:10.739
But what if he actually escapes?

13:14.060 --> 13:15.619
Missing from camp for seven days

13:15.739 --> 13:16.700
will be reported.

13:17.980 --> 13:19.300
Declared dead after half a month.

13:19.739 --> 13:21.659
If he does come back,

13:22.940 --> 13:24.259
it's too late.

13:29.220 --> 13:29.859
He's back.

13:31.580 --> 13:32.420
What's the news?

13:32.739 --> 13:33.899
Any word on Mr. Zhao?

13:35.259 --> 13:35.940
No.

13:36.580 --> 13:37.379
Don't worry, Miss Xie.

13:37.820 --> 13:38.539
Mr. Zhao

13:38.539 --> 13:39.499
is favored by fate.

13:39.739 --> 13:40.539
He'll be fine.

13:46.859 --> 13:47.580
Feed the horse.

13:48.180 --> 13:48.739
Sure thing.

13:50.899 --> 13:51.580
Cheers.

13:51.580 --> 13:52.300
Drink up!

13:55.659 --> 13:56.659
Fill the cup!

13:57.180 --> 13:58.539
Alright.

14:02.220 --> 14:03.100
These men's arrival

14:04.100 --> 14:05.259
is suspicious.

14:06.619 --> 14:07.899
They don't seem like bandits.

14:08.340 --> 14:09.220
Come, lend a hand.

14:09.340 --> 14:10.180
Come on.

14:10.739 --> 14:11.820
They seem more like

14:11.820 --> 14:12.859
salt smugglers.

14:13.340 --> 14:14.060
Unload the cart.

14:14.460 --> 14:15.019
Got it.

14:17.220 --> 14:19.100
How would salt smugglers get warhorses?

14:20.539 --> 14:22.259
Wu, come here.

14:22.259 --> 14:22.700
Coming.

14:22.700 --> 14:23.460
Bottoms up.

14:24.820 --> 14:25.619
Keep a close watch.

14:28.580 --> 14:29.460
Are you hurt?

14:30.100 --> 14:30.739
I'm fine.

14:31.859 --> 14:33.060
Let's stand up first.

14:33.739 --> 14:35.779
We can plan once we get these ropes off.

14:51.300 --> 14:52.580
Why are you standing here?

14:56.259 --> 14:57.859
You two are out of luck.

14:57.859 --> 14:58.820
You ran into us.

14:59.100 --> 15:00.460
My brothers haven't had meat

15:00.460 --> 15:01.539
in weeks.

15:02.300 --> 15:03.139
How can we drink

15:04.580 --> 15:05.580
without meat?

15:07.899 --> 15:08.820
Kill you two,

15:09.739 --> 15:10.779
then we'll have our meat.

15:11.460 --> 15:12.460
But without salt, how will that work?

15:15.139 --> 15:16.180
You are professional.

15:17.340 --> 15:17.739
Come.

15:18.100 --> 15:18.619
Tell me.

15:18.940 --> 15:19.659
What is the situation?

15:24.539 --> 15:25.899
Before I joined the army,

15:27.060 --> 15:28.619
I used to be a salt smuggler too.

15:29.499 --> 15:30.340
Just like you.

15:31.700 --> 15:32.700
Me too.

15:33.060 --> 15:34.619
You two really have some skill.

15:36.259 --> 15:38.460
We're looking to bring
more men into our ranks.

15:39.460 --> 15:40.940
Looks like fate has brought us together.

15:41.980 --> 15:43.060
Why not join us?

15:46.220 --> 15:47.180
But between the two of you,

15:47.539 --> 15:48.659
I can only keep one.

15:49.899 --> 15:50.739
Whoever survives

15:51.980 --> 15:52.700
gets to stay.

16:00.859 --> 16:01.859
Here are the weapons.

16:02.139 --> 16:03.259
Take your pick.

16:04.060 --> 16:06.220
A petty official like that
means nothing.

16:07.300 --> 16:08.180
As I said,

16:08.659 --> 16:09.220
today,

16:09.739 --> 16:11.220
whoever walks out of here alive

16:11.859 --> 16:13.300
will be second-in-command

16:13.300 --> 16:14.379
here.

16:14.820 --> 16:15.739
Silvers, women,

16:16.100 --> 16:17.060
meats and wine.

16:17.499 --> 16:18.180
Whatever you want,

16:18.619 --> 16:19.659
I'll give it to you.

16:20.180 --> 16:26.019
Good!

16:32.499 --> 16:33.220
I'll take this one.

16:33.940 --> 16:35.619
Mr. Zhao, forgive me.

16:49.019 --> 16:50.139
Very well.

16:50.619 --> 16:51.940
Since you didn't treat me
like a brother,

16:53.580 --> 16:55.379
then I don't need
to be polite with you either.

17:00.619 --> 17:03.420
Excellent!

17:03.739 --> 17:04.460
He's got some strength.

17:04.499 --> 17:05.900
Kill him!

17:06.620 --> 17:07.140
Good!

17:09.180 --> 17:09.819
Good!

17:10.900 --> 17:11.380
Go get him!

17:12.220 --> 17:12.700
Good!

17:13.539 --> 17:14.099
Go!

17:14.620 --> 17:15.380
Fighting like dogs.

17:15.380 --> 17:16.019
How satisfying!

17:16.579 --> 17:17.900
Mr. Tuo, you really know
how to have fun.

17:20.105 --> 17:25.832
♪The wind sweeps the yellow sands
as a long song rises♪

17:26.138 --> 17:30.339
♪A lone rider heads
for the distant frontier♪

17:32.212 --> 17:37.712
♪The road stretches on,
swallowed by wind and sand♪

17:39.059 --> 17:41.099
Excellent!

17:41.099 --> 17:43.099
Kill him!

17:43.099 --> 17:47.840
Good!

17:47.840 --> 17:53.460
♪Let the yellow sands bury the bones
of who I was♪

17:53.460 --> 17:59.040
♪Still, my resolve has never wavered♪

17:59.859 --> 18:03.859
♪I lift a cup of humble wine
to the passing breeze♪

18:03.900 --> 18:04.940
There's a fire!

18:05.299 --> 18:05.940
Yucheng!

18:07.860 --> 18:09.579
Quick, stop them!

18:15.499 --> 18:16.339
Miss Xie.

18:16.660 --> 18:17.940
- Miss Xie.
- Come on, Miss Xie!

18:17.940 --> 18:19.700
I brought
your favorite sesame flatbread.

18:20.579 --> 18:21.900
Freshly dried sweet apricots.

18:21.900 --> 18:22.420
Try some.

18:24.779 --> 18:26.339
Why are your eyes red?

18:27.819 --> 18:29.980
Must be worrying about
Banner Commander Zhao.

18:29.980 --> 18:30.620
Miss Xie.

18:31.420 --> 18:32.099
Miss Xie.

18:33.860 --> 18:34.940
Lord Li

18:35.339 --> 18:36.499
has come to our house.

18:51.180 --> 18:53.819
Banner Commander Zhao has been held
by bandits for seven days.

18:54.180 --> 18:55.259
No ransom request,

18:55.499 --> 18:56.739
or a word at all.

18:57.140 --> 18:58.059
By custom,

18:59.019 --> 19:00.420
he is to be declared dead in the line
of duty.

19:05.140 --> 19:05.539
Let's leave.

19:05.539 --> 19:06.900
You have no body,

19:07.779 --> 19:08.819
no certificate

19:08.980 --> 19:10.539
from the authorities
confirming his death.

19:11.660 --> 19:12.739
And Zhao Ling

19:12.739 --> 19:13.980
hasn't even been missing
for half a month.

19:14.980 --> 19:16.339
How can you be so sure

19:16.499 --> 19:17.539
that Zhao Ling is dead?

19:17.860 --> 19:19.019
This is settled.

19:19.380 --> 19:20.499
No more argument.

19:21.099 --> 19:22.860
The Admonitions for Women Hall
has prepared

19:22.860 --> 19:24.220
(Admonitions for Women)
a fine quarter for you.

19:24.700 --> 19:25.499
Ms. Zuo

19:26.099 --> 19:27.819
will guide you properly.

19:27.819 --> 19:28.339
No way.

19:29.299 --> 19:30.739
You want to use our young lady

19:31.180 --> 19:32.339
to earn a chastity memorial arch

19:32.620 --> 19:33.779
and report it to the capital

19:33.779 --> 19:34.980
for your own merit.

19:38.819 --> 19:39.900
Today, you decide

19:40.019 --> 19:41.420
whether Zhao Ling lives or dies.

19:42.180 --> 19:42.860
Some day,

19:43.380 --> 19:45.380
when someone decides your future,

19:46.220 --> 19:47.180
I hope you

19:47.620 --> 19:48.860
will be just as decisive.

19:56.140 --> 19:57.059
What do we do now?

19:57.059 --> 19:57.700
Don't panic.

19:57.940 --> 19:59.380
I've gone to beg Madam Wang
to intervene.

19:59.819 --> 20:00.499
Maybe

20:00.860 --> 20:02.140
there's still room to turn this around.

20:12.019 --> 20:13.059
Ninth Young Lady.

20:13.660 --> 20:14.900
Does this room

20:14.900 --> 20:16.299
look familiar to you?

20:18.420 --> 20:20.499
Doesn't it remind you
of the Fu family in Huaying?

20:27.140 --> 20:28.019
Go ahead. Touch it.

20:28.579 --> 20:30.059
Feel the grain of these bricks.

20:31.339 --> 20:33.180
The innermost room of the west wing.

20:33.980 --> 20:35.299
Laid crosswise and lengthwise,

20:35.940 --> 20:37.380
one hundred and eight bricks in total.

20:38.900 --> 20:40.739
On those sleepless nights,

20:41.299 --> 20:42.900
I used to count them over and over.

20:45.779 --> 20:47.180
Now these bricks

20:48.499 --> 20:50.380
will require you, Ninth Young Lady,

20:50.779 --> 20:52.140
to count them yourself.

20:55.900 --> 20:57.660
When the nights were hard to bear,

20:59.739 --> 21:01.779
I would take this copper coin

21:02.579 --> 21:03.900
and rub it against the brick

21:05.140 --> 21:06.980
over

21:07.380 --> 21:08.980
and over.

21:11.299 --> 21:11.940
Take a guess.

21:12.940 --> 21:14.099
How long does it take

21:17.019 --> 21:18.700
to wear one down smooth?

21:25.819 --> 21:26.380
Let me go.

21:27.259 --> 21:27.900
Let me go!

21:29.220 --> 21:29.940
Release me!

21:37.339 --> 21:38.620
On the first day of every month,

21:39.140 --> 21:41.499
I must drink a bowl of Chastity Tonic.

21:42.940 --> 21:44.940
Do you know what the Chastity Tonic is?

21:45.779 --> 21:47.700
It's a decoction brewed

21:48.059 --> 21:49.019
from gelsemium elegans,

21:49.299 --> 21:51.739
musk, and arsenic.

21:52.539 --> 21:53.539
Drink it,

21:54.299 --> 21:56.539
and your skin will decay,

21:57.299 --> 21:59.059
your hair will turn white,

22:00.180 --> 22:01.860
and you'll never bear children.

22:02.980 --> 22:04.620
This soup

22:05.099 --> 22:06.499
is bitter.

22:07.220 --> 22:08.579
But what's bitterest

22:09.700 --> 22:11.499
is the chipped rim of the bowl.

22:13.059 --> 22:16.099
Over time, it wears your lips raw.

22:17.539 --> 22:18.940
Ten years

22:18.940 --> 22:22.180
are enough to forge a mouth
no longer knows how to cry out in pain.

22:25.819 --> 22:26.900
I've endured

22:28.739 --> 22:30.220
all this suffering.

22:33.140 --> 22:34.059
Now,

22:34.779 --> 22:36.860
it's finally your turn.

22:37.620 --> 22:38.660
Drink it.

22:39.140 --> 22:40.259
Drink it now!

22:41.259 --> 22:41.900
Drink!

22:45.700 --> 22:46.700
The Fu family

22:46.700 --> 22:48.819
left me a widow for ten years.

22:49.779 --> 22:51.860
You should suffer as I did.

22:52.299 --> 22:54.460
Feel what I endured for ten years.

22:56.460 --> 22:57.380
You're mad.

22:58.819 --> 23:00.420
I was getting better.

23:02.660 --> 23:04.620
I had someone by my side at night.

23:05.739 --> 23:06.819
But then you came.

23:07.579 --> 23:08.779
And it all came back,

23:08.779 --> 23:11.579
those ten years I lived like a beast.

23:15.860 --> 23:18.660
We could have stayed
out of each other's way.

23:22.539 --> 23:25.220
Why must you keep coming after me?

23:27.380 --> 23:29.140
Why did you have to come to Ganlin?

23:31.660 --> 23:32.579
How about

23:33.980 --> 23:35.460
you live this life

23:39.860 --> 23:41.739
for me instead?

24:19.019 --> 24:19.900
I'm sorry I'm late.

24:24.220 --> 24:25.180
I knew it.

24:27.819 --> 24:29.579
I knew you wouldn't die.

24:34.940 --> 24:36.779
What's the point
of all that bluster now?

24:40.019 --> 24:40.980
Zhao Ling.

24:41.980 --> 24:43.860
Don't think that a little skill alone

24:43.980 --> 24:45.779
can take you straight to the top.

24:46.499 --> 24:47.460
The world

24:48.579 --> 24:50.620
isn't as simple as you think.

24:51.380 --> 24:52.620
I'm telling you,

24:52.779 --> 24:54.940
your career ends right here.

24:55.140 --> 24:55.860
From now on,

24:56.739 --> 24:58.380
you won't go any further.

25:17.940 --> 25:18.539
Let's go home.

25:26.900 --> 25:27.539
What?

25:29.660 --> 25:30.660
There are women inside.

25:33.391 --> 25:35.691
(Admonitions for Women Hall)

25:35.739 --> 25:36.620
Mr. Zhao.

25:37.460 --> 25:38.779
We can't just let this go.

25:39.539 --> 25:40.259
Let's go back.

25:42.860 --> 25:44.140
Are you just letting that viper off?

25:46.180 --> 25:46.700
Of course not.

25:48.860 --> 25:50.380
(Admonitions for Women Hall)
We'll settle the score, one by one.

25:52.980 --> 25:54.059
If I don't avenge this,

25:56.700 --> 25:58.140
how could I ever marry her?

26:35.099 --> 26:36.059
I'm fine.

26:38.980 --> 26:40.819
I'm just glad you came back safely.

26:43.739 --> 26:45.460
It's not being a widow that I fear.

26:51.620 --> 26:53.380
What I fear

26:58.700 --> 27:00.059
is a world without you in it.

27:28.310 --> 27:32.177
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

27:37.940 --> 27:38.700
What?

27:40.339 --> 27:41.460
I have few family ties.

27:42.660 --> 27:43.779
And I come from the army.

27:44.259 --> 27:45.339
So I don't care much for those taboos.

27:47.860 --> 27:48.940
I'm afraid
you'll have to make do with this.

27:51.136 --> 27:55.597
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

27:59.029 --> 28:05.763
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye
will fill my eyes with tears♪

28:07.217 --> 28:13.375
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

28:13.815 --> 28:17.328
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

28:17.850 --> 28:22.037
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

28:22.423 --> 28:28.050
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

28:46.460 --> 28:47.940
I was too impatient.

28:49.180 --> 28:51.140
All I could think of was refining
cliff salt to earn a promotion.

28:52.460 --> 28:53.900
Once I've made something of myself

28:55.860 --> 28:56.900
and earned the right to marry you...

28:56.930 --> 29:00.272
♪So light, yet my steps
still pause for you♪

29:01.220 --> 29:02.980
I will never let you suffer again.

29:02.991 --> 29:07.080
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

29:07.231 --> 29:09.900
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

29:11.058 --> 29:15.760
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

29:19.149 --> 29:25.863
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

29:27.183 --> 29:33.383
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

29:34.043 --> 29:37.343
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

29:38.150 --> 29:42.290
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

29:42.940 --> 29:43.940
This is a peachwood hairpin.

29:43.940 --> 29:44.700
Though

29:44.700 --> 29:45.299
it's not valuable,

29:45.660 --> 29:46.620
my mother said

29:47.420 --> 29:48.140
it wards off evil.

29:51.019 --> 29:51.660
Just take it.

29:52.819 --> 29:53.460
I...

29:53.460 --> 29:56.339
I spent all my money on sweet cakes
the day before yesterday.

29:57.339 --> 30:00.180
So I just pulled some foxtails
from the wall and wove this.

30:00.779 --> 30:01.339
From now on,

30:01.620 --> 30:02.819
I'll be more careful with my money.

30:08.339 --> 30:09.499
And I have something too, Miss Xie.

30:09.579 --> 30:10.339
This is a hair ribbon.

30:10.579 --> 30:11.099
Miss Xie,

30:11.099 --> 30:11.739
this is a comb.

30:21.819 --> 30:22.819
Thank you all.

30:30.840 --> 30:32.760
(Yu Residence)

30:42.299 --> 30:42.940
Young Master.

30:44.059 --> 30:45.059
Open it and have a look.

30:45.700 --> 30:46.339
Thank you.

30:47.220 --> 30:48.019
Just leave it there.

30:49.940 --> 30:51.180
Do open it and see.

30:56.299 --> 30:58.499
I sewed it with pale cream thread,

30:58.860 --> 31:00.579
with stitches as delicate
as the color of narcissus.

31:06.059 --> 31:07.140
But this is the color of ink.

31:11.420 --> 31:12.539
None of you should waste your thoughts

31:12.539 --> 31:13.739
on such matters.

31:15.499 --> 31:16.140
Yake,

31:16.739 --> 31:18.019
attend to Mother,

31:18.499 --> 31:19.499
manage the household,

31:20.620 --> 31:21.779
and I will not be unkind to you.

31:39.819 --> 31:40.420
Mother.

31:41.940 --> 31:43.579
It's so late. Why aren't you resting?

31:44.779 --> 31:46.460
You even came to pay your respects.

31:47.620 --> 31:48.819
I came

31:50.220 --> 31:51.499
to speak to you about Yake.

31:55.380 --> 31:55.980
Mother.

31:57.180 --> 31:59.140
It hasn't been easy for her,
marrying from Huaying to the capital.

32:01.099 --> 32:02.499
I beg you to show her compassion.

32:02.900 --> 32:03.779
Leave her someone

32:04.739 --> 32:05.980
to talk to by her side.

32:11.620 --> 32:12.539
I beg you,

32:14.019 --> 32:14.819
Mother,

32:15.739 --> 32:16.940
to relent.

32:22.940 --> 32:24.739
My son sees things clearly.

32:26.940 --> 32:28.420
But a mother

32:29.819 --> 32:31.019
who acts for her son

32:31.539 --> 32:32.620
can have no ill intent.

32:39.539 --> 32:40.420
Rest assured.

32:42.259 --> 32:43.819
As for matters within your chambers,

32:44.819 --> 32:46.180
I will not interfere.

32:47.579 --> 32:48.460
Thank you, Mother.

32:50.380 --> 32:50.940
Then

32:52.099 --> 32:53.140
I will take my leave.

33:00.620 --> 33:02.460
Once trust between hearts

33:03.819 --> 33:05.220
is cracked,

33:05.900 --> 33:07.620
it will shatter more completely.

33:08.299 --> 33:09.499
When she has no one

33:09.499 --> 33:11.259
to speak to in this house,

33:13.059 --> 33:15.299
let's see if she still dares
to act so high and mighty with me.

33:27.259 --> 33:29.579
You were taken up the mountain
by bandits,

33:30.420 --> 33:32.980
and yet you came back in one piece.

33:35.420 --> 33:37.579
You've got some skill.

33:41.860 --> 33:42.779
You are too kind, My Lord.

33:43.940 --> 33:45.019
I was just

33:45.460 --> 33:46.220
lucky.

33:47.180 --> 33:48.620
I waited until they were drunk,

33:48.940 --> 33:50.420
then slipped my ropes and ran back.

33:53.099 --> 33:53.779
My Lord,

33:55.620 --> 33:57.380
now that we've found the salt mine,

33:59.980 --> 34:01.299
what about what you promised me?

34:01.299 --> 34:03.059
I did indeed make a promise.

34:04.220 --> 34:05.980
But this time,
I'm afraid I'll have to break it.

34:07.059 --> 34:08.699
We'll find another chance

34:08.860 --> 34:10.380
to reward you for your merits.

34:11.019 --> 34:11.659
Why?

34:13.900 --> 34:15.699
I made a promise to my brothers.

34:16.340 --> 34:17.780
I said I'd lead them to a better future.

34:18.940 --> 34:20.380
And now...

34:22.340 --> 34:23.900
How am I supposed to face them?

34:23.900 --> 34:26.059
Then you should think carefully

34:26.780 --> 34:27.539
about

34:28.659 --> 34:30.820
whether you've offended anyone lately.

34:35.099 --> 34:37.300
(Your career ends right here.)

34:37.460 --> 34:38.219
(From now on,)

34:38.619 --> 34:40.219
(you won't go any further.)

34:46.219 --> 34:48.059
The promised merit, gone just like that.

34:48.619 --> 34:49.740
This lousy job.

34:49.980 --> 34:51.420
It's not even as good
as when we smuggled salt.

34:51.420 --> 34:52.139
That was more satisfying.

34:52.499 --> 34:53.659
This lousy token.

34:53.659 --> 34:54.539
Whoever wants it can have it.

34:54.539 --> 34:55.179
Right.

34:55.179 --> 34:56.340
Who cares about this thing anyway?

35:13.219 --> 35:13.659
Right.

35:13.685 --> 35:14.379
(Yan Guard)

35:14.420 --> 35:15.460
You two are right.

35:17.499 --> 35:18.619
But my mother always said,

35:19.380 --> 35:20.219
one should always walk

35:21.579 --> 35:22.579
the righteous path.

35:26.059 --> 35:26.539
Come on.

35:34.380 --> 35:34.980
Chuan.

35:41.820 --> 35:43.499
From now on, don't ever say such things.

35:44.139 --> 35:45.460
Deep down, Mr. Zhao

35:45.460 --> 35:46.420
has it harder than any of us.

35:50.860 --> 35:51.380
Mr...

35:55.099 --> 35:56.260
What's wrong, Mr. Zhao?

35:58.420 --> 35:59.260
Commander Wang

35:59.659 --> 36:00.420
went back on his word.

36:01.940 --> 36:03.059
My promotion

36:04.579 --> 36:05.780
may not happen anytime soon.

36:07.219 --> 36:08.740
The question is, who has Zuo

36:09.099 --> 36:10.260
managed to attach herself to,

36:10.820 --> 36:12.019
that even Commander Wang is wary of?

36:18.139 --> 36:19.340
Mr. Zhao, do you remember

36:20.219 --> 36:21.099
this piece of brocade?

36:23.019 --> 36:24.099
This cloud-geese pattern

36:24.300 --> 36:26.619
can only be worn by civil officials
of the junior fourth rank or above.

36:27.340 --> 36:28.900
This is an unfinished

36:28.900 --> 36:29.980
man's garment.

36:40.860 --> 36:41.780
Advisor Li?

36:45.340 --> 36:46.699
No wonder he insisted

36:47.780 --> 36:49.699
on forcing me
to the Admonitions for Women Hall.

36:50.699 --> 36:51.579
I had thought

36:52.019 --> 36:53.860
it was just for a chastity memorial arch

36:54.460 --> 36:55.699
to earn some political merit.

36:56.260 --> 36:57.099
I never expected

36:57.980 --> 36:59.460
it was all for Zuo.

37:04.260 --> 37:05.659
Now that we know who our opponent is,

37:05.980 --> 37:06.980
it'll be easier to deal with.

37:09.337 --> 37:11.897
(Admonitions for Women Hall)

37:21.460 --> 37:23.539
Why are you so clumsy?

37:23.740 --> 37:25.420
You can't even put my shoes on properly.

37:29.579 --> 37:30.860
Don't be scared.

37:32.940 --> 37:34.900
They've all been through it.

37:36.820 --> 37:37.699
Fawning over him, are you?

37:38.260 --> 37:39.420
You little tart.

37:40.300 --> 37:41.980
Dare to show off in front of me?

37:42.380 --> 37:43.219
You little jealous thing.

37:43.740 --> 37:45.139
She's just a girl.

37:45.539 --> 37:46.579
Not worth getting angry over.

37:54.659 --> 37:56.740
What's so fun

37:57.260 --> 37:58.659
about that little runt, Hanyan?

37:59.499 --> 38:01.059
Next time you come,

38:05.380 --> 38:07.179
I'll give you something even better.

38:12.219 --> 38:14.699
You really know
how to make people happy.

38:24.499 --> 38:25.460
Remember,

38:25.460 --> 38:26.820
use the side door at the back.

38:27.219 --> 38:28.820
Don't let anyone see you.

38:35.900 --> 38:36.740
From now on,

38:38.340 --> 38:39.980
you don't need to serve here anymore.

38:50.579 --> 38:52.019
Those ten years with the Fu family,

38:55.980 --> 38:58.099
only you and I had each other.

39:02.219 --> 39:03.619
These men,

39:04.699 --> 39:06.699
they see a woman and want to demean her.

39:07.699 --> 39:08.659
In this house,

39:14.380 --> 39:16.619
it's enough that one of us
has to live in the shadows.

39:19.833 --> 39:21.666
(Virtuous, Serene and Proper)

39:27.980 --> 39:29.219
Look at this embroidery.

39:29.219 --> 39:29.900
Do you like it?

39:31.619 --> 39:32.619
It's beautiful.

39:33.099 --> 39:34.059
This one is beautiful too.

39:39.260 --> 39:40.420
Where is my shoe?

39:40.780 --> 39:42.179
Why is there only one left?

39:45.019 --> 39:46.820
This is the third time this month.

39:47.219 --> 39:48.539
Last time it was a handkerchief.

39:48.940 --> 39:50.380
Before that, a bracelet.

39:50.539 --> 39:51.659
And now today,

39:51.900 --> 39:53.019
even the shoe went missing.

39:55.340 --> 39:56.539
Could it be

39:57.059 --> 39:58.139
haunted?

39:59.420 --> 40:00.980
Have you heard, Miss Xie?

40:01.380 --> 40:02.699
Strange things have been happening

40:02.699 --> 40:03.579
at the Admonitions for Women Hall.

40:04.219 --> 40:06.099
The embroidered shoes of Miss Wang

40:06.099 --> 40:07.619
disappeared

40:07.619 --> 40:09.099
in plain sight.

40:10.539 --> 40:12.860
My little sister is learning
at the Admonitions for Women Hall too.

40:12.860 --> 40:14.340
Oh, what should we do?

40:17.099 --> 40:18.219
In this world,

40:18.219 --> 40:19.059
there are no ghosts or spirits.

40:20.019 --> 40:22.300
Someone is just playing tricks
behind it all.

40:24.219 --> 40:25.619
Please don't worry.

40:25.780 --> 40:26.659
I will get to the bottom

40:26.659 --> 40:28.499
of this matter.

40:29.059 --> 40:29.820
- Alright.
- Alright.

40:30.659 --> 40:31.820
Sister, let's leave.

40:32.499 --> 40:33.539
Be careful on the way.

40:33.539 --> 40:34.219
- Okay.
- Okay.

40:34.780 --> 40:35.340
Let's go.

40:35.740 --> 40:36.179
Let's go.

40:37.260 --> 40:38.980
Is what you said true?

40:38.980 --> 40:39.980
Of course it's true.

40:39.980 --> 40:40.900
How terrifying.

40:52.420 --> 40:53.539
There is indeed something wrong.

40:55.940 --> 40:57.860
Could it be that Advisor Li

40:58.179 --> 40:59.780
hides under the cabinet to peek

41:00.539 --> 41:02.820
and steals
the girls' personal belongings?

41:05.699 --> 41:07.300
What a beast.

41:07.900 --> 41:09.260
We need a plan

41:10.219 --> 41:11.940
to draw this snake out.

41:13.139 --> 41:14.340
That way, we get rid of the menace

41:15.420 --> 41:17.539
and keep the students
from being harmed by Zuo.

41:19.060 --> 41:21.060
(Advisory Hall)

41:21.099 --> 41:21.860
My Lord.

41:21.860 --> 41:23.699
Are you heading
to the ancestral hall again?

41:24.019 --> 41:25.260
Isn't it almost time to knock off?

41:25.380 --> 41:26.420
It's getting late.

41:26.659 --> 41:27.699
I'm going to the ancestral hall

41:27.699 --> 41:28.900
to burn incense for my late mother.

41:29.579 --> 41:30.579
As a son,

41:30.820 --> 41:32.659
one should never forget

41:32.659 --> 41:34.059
the kindness of one's parents.

41:34.059 --> 41:36.860
No wonder you're famous
far and wide as a filial son.

41:38.019 --> 41:39.499
This is the way
to the Admonitions for Women Hall.

41:39.780 --> 41:40.860
His ancestral graves

41:41.019 --> 41:42.059
are at the Admonitions for Women Hall?

41:44.659 --> 41:45.380
Third Brother,

41:46.059 --> 41:47.019
when are we

41:47.019 --> 41:48.139
going to make our move?

41:48.860 --> 41:49.499
Not yet.

41:49.699 --> 41:50.860
Let's go tell Miss Xie first.

41:55.179 --> 41:56.940
I came to let you know I'm safe.

41:57.340 --> 41:58.699
I heard that a few days ago,

41:58.699 --> 41:59.740
you went to great lengths for me.

42:00.420 --> 42:01.980
But because of the rules,

42:01.980 --> 42:02.860
you couldn't break them.

42:03.499 --> 42:04.699
Still, I will remember

42:04.820 --> 42:05.900
this kindness.

42:08.380 --> 42:10.139
You look to be in one piece.

42:10.179 --> 42:11.579
They didn't wear you down at all.

42:13.340 --> 42:15.019
Thank you for your concern, Madam.

42:15.420 --> 42:16.380
I will always remember it.

42:16.940 --> 42:18.659
Thankfully,
Zhao Ling is quick on his feet.

42:19.340 --> 42:20.619
It was a close call, but no harm done.

42:21.019 --> 42:21.659
Don't stand.

42:21.659 --> 42:22.059
Have a seat.

42:26.380 --> 42:27.619
Madam, have you heard

42:27.619 --> 42:29.179
from Miss Mo

42:29.300 --> 42:31.619
about the strange happenings
at the Admonitions for Women Hall?

42:33.179 --> 42:33.860
Strange happenings?

42:38.460 --> 42:40.499
Miss Wang's embroidered shoe

42:40.499 --> 42:41.619
vanished into thin air.

42:42.139 --> 42:43.780
Miss Qian's handkerchief

42:43.780 --> 42:45.139
also went missing for no reason.

42:45.619 --> 42:47.699
I suspect Zuo is hiding a man in there,

42:47.699 --> 42:49.460
damaging the young ladies' reputations.

42:49.740 --> 42:51.420
Now I need your help, Madam.

42:51.900 --> 42:53.219
This kind of filth

42:53.420 --> 42:55.420
needs someone like you
to put a stop to it.

43:00.300 --> 43:01.260
Fine.

43:01.499 --> 43:04.019
Let me see which filthy scoundrel

43:04.219 --> 43:06.579
dares to play tricks
right under my nose.

43:21.103 --> 43:24.800
(Admonitions for Women Hall)

43:27.744 --> 43:29.544
(Admonitions for Women Hall)

43:31.833 --> 43:33.730
(Admonitions for Women Hall)

43:35.619 --> 43:36.380
Open the door!

43:36.860 --> 43:37.619
Open the door!

43:38.260 --> 43:39.059
Open the door now!

43:39.059 --> 43:39.740
Open the door!

43:46.036 --> 43:48.561
(Next Episode)

43:49.380 --> 43:50.460
I just received my orders.

43:50.900 --> 43:52.619
I'm escorting supplies
to Shaqiong Town tomorrow.

43:53.300 --> 43:54.659
Take care while you're in Ganlin Town.

43:56.539 --> 43:58.860
Do you think I got where I am today

43:59.619 --> 44:02.460
because of my brother-in-law?

44:03.659 --> 44:04.499
It's because

44:04.699 --> 44:06.860
I am better

44:07.260 --> 44:08.820
than all you useless scum.

44:10.579 --> 44:12.340
Just one rank above you,

44:13.619 --> 44:14.940
and I can crush you.

44:18.659 --> 44:20.460
Zhao Ling attacked a superior officer.

44:20.740 --> 44:22.139
He defied military orders.

44:22.900 --> 44:24.499
Kill him on sight!

44:36.800 --> 44:41.120
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

44:44.720 --> 44:49.080
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

44:51.200 --> 44:55.840
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

44:56.080 --> 44:58.880
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

45:00.040 --> 45:04.680
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

45:07.880 --> 45:14.720
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

45:15.600 --> 45:22.120
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

45:23.080 --> 45:26.520
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

45:27.040 --> 45:31.240
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

45:31.520 --> 45:37.200
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

45:49.320 --> 45:53.200
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

45:57.120 --> 46:01.120
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

46:02.840 --> 46:07.520
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

46:07.840 --> 46:10.520
♪Kept close within my heart♪

46:11.600 --> 46:16.440
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

46:19.960 --> 46:26.880
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

46:27.760 --> 46:34.240
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

46:35.120 --> 46:38.640
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

46:39.080 --> 46:43.440
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

46:43.640 --> 46:49.360
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
